If instead of summing horizontally, we sum vertically, we get $n = (2^{m}-1)x_{m}+(2^{m-1}-1)x_{m-1}+\cdots+ x_{1}$ which can be written as a sum of  $2^{k}-1$ , which shows the bijection.

