\dfrac{BI}{\sin(\angle BAI)} = \dfrac{BA}{\sin(\angle AIB)} &\implies \dfrac{BI}{\sin(90 - \angle C)} = \dfrac{BA}{\sin\left(90 + \tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)} 
