Similarly, as  $\angle ADB = \tfrac{3}{2}\angle C$ , then:
\begin{align*}
\dfrac{DA}{\sin\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)} = \dfrac{BA}{\sin\left(\tfrac{3}{2}\angle C\right)} \implies DA = \dfrac{BA \cdot \sin\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)}{\sin\left(\tfrac{3}{2}\angle C\right)}
