But, 
\begin{align*}
DE &= \tan(90 - \angle C) \cdot DA 
&=\tan(90 -\angle C) \cdot \dfrac{BA \cdot \sin\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)}{\sin\left(\tfrac{3}{2}\angle C\right)}
\end{align*}
Thus,
\begin{align*}
\dfrac{BI}{DE} &= \dfrac{BA\cdot \sin(90 - \angle C)}{\sin\left(90 + \tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)} \cdot \dfrac{\sin\left(\tfrac{3}{2}\angle C\right)}{BA \cdot \tan(90 -\angle C) \cdot \sin\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)} 
