&= \dfrac{\sin(\angle C) \cdot \sin\left(\tfrac{3}{2}\angle C\right)}{\cos\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right) \cdot \sin\left(\tfrac{1}{2}\angle C\right)} 
