        \end{vmatrix}=0$      $\iff \begin{vmatrix}
\frac{(xy+xz+yz)(y^2+z^2)x}{yz(x+y+z)+(xy+xz+yz)x} & \frac{(x+y+z)(y^2+z^2)}{yz(yz(x+y+z)+(xy+xz+yz)x)} & 1 
